      "title": "Lua: Get the length of stringz from the TVB API, and return it",
      "message": "Lua: Get the length of stringz from the TVB API, and return it\n\nInstead of having TvbRange_stringz do its own length calculation, which\nis wrong for some encodings and will be redone by tvb_get_stringz_enc\nanyway, just rely on the TVB API to get the correct value. Also, push\nthe length of the string obtained as a second return value.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
